This is the 1.0.1 development baseline cutover; the production TOC version
remains 1.0.0 until release hardening. A version string alone does not determine
which distribution or license applies.

Official CarGOUI distributions may be installed and run for personal gameplay.
Except for that use, rights permitted by applicable law, and separate written
permission from the owner, no permission is granted to copy, modify,
redistribute, sublicense, or sell the project-owned source. Public availability
of the repository does not grant an open-source license to post-cutover source.

For the combination with the embedded LibSharedMedia-3.0 library, you may
modify CarGOUI for your own use and reverse engineer it for debugging those
